*.local

# Rust / Tauri
src-tauri/target/
# Isolated release-build target dir (CARGO_TARGET_DIR=target-v3): ~2 GB of
# regenerable artifacts. Deleted in the 0.1.1 closeout; ignored so a future
# isolated build cannot be swept into history by `git add -A`.
src-tauri/target-v3/
# A second isolated target dir (CARGO_TARGET_DIR=target-verify) used when running
# `cargo run --example ...` against a throwaway profile while another build holds
# the default one. ~4 GB of regenerable artifacts, deleted after each use and
# ignored so a leaked one cannot be added by `git add -A`.
src-tauri/target-verify/
src-tauri/gen/

